{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y的感受词大多静态并列，缺少X按音乐进程逐步出现的层次，尤其在乐句转折和尾声处，音乐与文字的同步感弱一些。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右分区比较稳定，左侧完整叙述负责交代事情，右侧短词补充身体和情绪体验，普通观众可以选择性扫读，不必在大量交替信息之间来回切换；完整句子的因果关系也让人物为什么靠近、为什么退缩、为什么逐渐改变更容易理解，前后成长线更连贯。X的关键词加亮和分时出现的感受词确实更有音乐同步感，局部情绪变化也更细，但部分段落感受词过密，个别比喻和心理解释显得用力，容易让观众忙于接收信息。综合实际观看体验，我选Y，X则在视觉抓重点和音乐细节同步方面有明显优势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "814735ca-95f2-43f3-83a8-474f4ff37276", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T193716235180Z", "elapsed_seconds": 222.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:40:58.657373+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1be68cc9091b6b09c0bd957df484d00213295dd40a0447abf1c75418c0aea933", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc